\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord can help Doing Hawaii turn existing content, community, and Kilauea credibility into a cleaner digital product. The first step does not need to be complicated. A practical starting point could be a featured creator placement, a small content partnership, or a polished supporter landing page. From there, the relationship can grow into a full media portal or custom app if the audience responds.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Stronger Partnership Pitch\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Doing Hawaii already has what many apps lack: an authentic story, a specific audience, and original Kilauea-related content. RootRecord already has what many creators lack: mobile app infrastructure, cloud APIs, account systems, Google Play release experience, and a Kilauea-focused app surface.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Putting those together could create something stronger than either side alone:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Doing Hawaii gains better distribution and organization.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Kilauea Alerts gains richer local creator content.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Users get official-source context plus local visual storytelling.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Supporters get a clearer way to engage.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
