\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab "There is already a lot of value here."\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab "The next step is making it easier for people to access."\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab "The story around the 2018 eruption is powerful."\par
