\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Lava Sample / Shop Items\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 The shop page references 2018 Kilauea eruption lava samples collected from private property and available to US addresses only as donation-related gifts.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 This may be legitimate, but because lava/rock collection and sale can be sensitive depending on source, land, permits, shipping, park boundaries, cultural concerns, and platform policies, RootRecord should be careful about promoting physical lava samples without reviewing details.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Recommended approach:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Do not make the lava sample offer the first partnership focus.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab If it comes up, ask for collection rights, property details, and comfort with public promotion.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Keep the initial partnership centered on media/content, not physical samples.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Official Agency Separation\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Doing Hawaii content should not be presented as official USGS/HVO/NWS content.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Sponsorship Fit\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Any sponsored content inside RootRecord apps should be relevant, calm, and non-misleading.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
