\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 The strongest fit appears to be a small first-step partnership around Kilauea Alerts: a featured Doing Hawaii creator placement, selected media links, or a small content feature that sends interested users back to Doing Hawaii. That would keep the project simple while testing audience interest.\par
