\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Longer term, there may also be a strong opportunity to modernize the Doing Hawaii content hub, clarify the supporter flow, and organize videos, photos, wallpapers, and Kilauea-related material into a cleaner web or app experience.\par
